Dialogue: 30,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.85,Dialogue Flashback,A,0,0,0,,Immoral Weapon?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:04.20,0:00:05.30,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:05.30,0:00:08.06,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,Your Heart Hybrid Gear contains
Dialogue: 30,0:00:08.06,0:00:11.33,Dialogue Flashback,,0,0,0,,a hidden weapon called an Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:12.16,0:00:15.20,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,You'll likely be able to use it
Dialogue: 30,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.24,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,once your Hybrid Count goes above a certain level.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:18.61,0:00:21.25,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,You should be able to get much stronger than you are now.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:22.09,0:00:23.99,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,Keep working hard.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:29.58,0:00:34.15,Dialogue Top Italics,R,0,0,0,,Deploying defensive armaments over Ataraxia and Megafloat Japan.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:35.65,0:00:37.19,Dialogue Top Italics,R,0,0,0,,Attention all students.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:37.76,0:00:40.64,Dialogue Top Italics,,0,0,0,,This is not a drill or a school event.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:38.37,0:00:40.22,Dialogue,Si,0,0,0,,Everyone, this way!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.64,Dialogue Top Italics,R,0,0,0,,This is a real battle!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:42.39,0:00:45.72,Dialogue Top Italics,R,0,0,0,,Show these otherworldly invaders what you've learned!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:46.92,0:00:50.03,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We'll show them all the things we've been working on!
