Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:25.50,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(483,452)\bord2.4\blur1.5\c&HFCFCFD&\fsp3\pos(548.5,883.715)}Episode 04
Dialogue: 30,0:02:21.79,0:02:24.12,Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,The enemy fleet is approaching Ataraxia at high speed.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:24.12,0:02:26.25,Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Fifty kilometers until we're in main gun range.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:26.75,0:02:29.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nee-chan, why can't I sortie?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:31.05,0:02:31.76,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.47,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Luck and fighting spirit won't help us against those numbers.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:40.47,0:02:42.02,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Your time will come later.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:44.44,0:02:48.19,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Amaterasu is now within range of the enemy Magitech weapons.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:49.86,0:02:50.69,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:50.69,0:02:54.32,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Your target is the enemy flagship, the 2000-meter-long battleship.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:54.32,0:02:58.45,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Destroy it before its main cannon comes within range of Megafloat Japan!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:58.45,0:02:59.87,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:01.16,0:03:02.79,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You make it sound so easy!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:08.83,0:03:09.79,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:38.45,0:03:39.41,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:54.67,0:03:56.55,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Don't focus so much on the Magitech weapons!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:57.47,0:04:00.55,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Thirty kilometers until we're within enemy battleship range.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:02.89,0:04:03.97,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:04.93,0:04:05.98,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:06.56,0:04:07.52,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,number one!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:21.74,0:04:22.91,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,A Dragorie...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:28.79,0:04:32.17,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Aine's Hybrid Count is falling faster than usual.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:32.79,0:04:35.17,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,If Chidorigafuchi's Count drops to zero...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:37.97,0:04:41.43,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Ten kilometers until we're within enemy battleship range.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:41.43,0:04:42.89,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:43.80,0:04:45.01,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,I'll show you...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:45.51,0:04:46.77,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,all I've got!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:52.27,0:04:55.27,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi, you're overusing your Absolute Zone!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:07.49,0:05:10.08,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I can defeat Category-A weapons, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:10.71,0:05:13.79,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm every bit as good as Julicia and Hayuru.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:13.79,0:05:15.21,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,You're overdoing it!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:15.21,0:05:17.05,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,That took your Hybrid Count all the way down to...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:17.38,0:05:20.01,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,It's less than ten percent!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:20.01,0:05:22.05,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That's plenty!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:23.18,0:05:25.22,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,Wait, Chidorigafuchi!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:31.06,0:05:31.94,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Wait, Kizuna—
Dialogue: 30,0:05:31.94,0:05:34.02,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We're now within range of the enemy battleship!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:35.94,0:05:38.03,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,Just wait, Chidorigafuchi!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:38.69,0:05:39.11,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,0,0,,Eros!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.41,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,I'm almost there...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:56.88,0:05:58.50,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,But I'm out of energy.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.16,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to go that way?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:31.70,0:06:32.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:33.50,0:06:34.92,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.29,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:36.29,0:06:37.54,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:38.67,0:06:40.17,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hida-kun...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:40.17,0:06:42.42,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Good, you're awake.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.05,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:45.63,0:06:47.64,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,The tuning room in Nayuta Labs.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:48.18,0:06:51.22,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You took a direct hit from\N the enemy ship, but you're safe.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:51.22,0:06:53.06,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I think you got lucky.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:53.56,0:06:55.39,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Stay down.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:55.89,0:06:58.56,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What's the situation?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:59.19,0:07:01.40,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Their cannons have stopped firing,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.82,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,but a drop squad of Magitech weapons is landing now.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:04.82,0:07:06.99,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I need to get back out there...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:06.99,0:07:07.82,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:08.87,0:07:13.29,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I can't send you out there, Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:13.79,0:07:14.33,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:16.79,0:07:17.71,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:17.71,0:07:20.50,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,My Hybrid Count is under five percent.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:21.88,0:07:26.01,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That means I can't even equip my Heart Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:31.18,0:07:31.68,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:32.31,0:07:35.77,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I can't let you go out there to die.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:35.77,0:07:37.19,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:37.69,0:07:40.81,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,The Heart Hybrid Gear is all I have.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:41.27,0:07:45.53,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm not allowed to be worse than anyone at using it!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:47.07,0:07:51.12,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And you're telling me I can't fight,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:52.53,0:07:55.58,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,or even equip my Gear?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:56.00,0:07:58.79,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That means I'm worthless.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:59.71,0:08:02.25,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,There's no reason for me to exist!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:02.79,0:08:05.09,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That just means there's no reason for me to live!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:06.51,0:08:07.93,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:08.47,0:08:10.59,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I have nothing.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:10.59,0:08:11.85,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.56,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't know who I am or where I'm from.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:14.56,0:08:17.60,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't remember my name, my home, or my family.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:21.61,0:08:23.11,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're not surprised, huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:24.23,0:08:25.53,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:25.53,0:08:28.20,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I was brought here to this lab.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:28.20,0:08:29.36,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And after that,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:29.78,0:08:33.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I spent all my time as a test subject in Dr. Nayuta's research.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:33.62,0:08:36.04,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't remember anything before being brought here.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:36.54,0:08:40.54,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And all I remember after that is being a guinea pig.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:42.21,0:08:44.25,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That's all I have.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:44.84,0:08:47.01,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,When I try to take an interest in something,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:47.01,0:08:52.26,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I start to wonder if the real me, \Nthe old me, would've cared about it.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.35,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And once that starts,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:54.35,0:08:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't bring myself to care anymore.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:57.22,0:09:02.31,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Once the combat tests started and \NI came to the high school, it got worse.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:02.85,0:09:05.07,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You never thought about making friends?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:05.57,0:09:08.11,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to be around other people.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:08.49,0:09:11.86,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Because I never talked to anyone at the lab.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:13.37,0:09:15.74,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm incapable of holding a conversation.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:18.12,0:09:22.25,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But there is one thing I can lean on.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:23.67,0:09:25.42,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,The Heart Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:27.13,0:09:28.84,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Whenever I got stronger,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dr. Nayuta praised me.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:30.72,0:09:32.30,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,She was happy with me.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:32.30,0:09:35.93,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I was the only one who could use\N the Heart Hybrid Gear back then.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:36.68,0:09:40.18,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But outside of that, there was nothing else I could do.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:41.18,0:09:44.23,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm better than anyone at using the Heart Hybrid Gear,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:44.23,0:09:45.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,and I'm stronger than anyone.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:45.90,0:09:47.19,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That's who I am!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.53,0:09:50.69,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But I can't defeat the enemy at all!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:54.82,0:09:57.87,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hayuru's defeated 200 enemies, and Julicia's defeated 300.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:57.87,0:10:00.04,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And I've only defeated 38.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:02.96,0:10:05.46,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Dr. Nayuta once told me...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:06.50,0:10:10.71,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,that there's an incredibly powerful "Immoral Weapon" inside me.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:11.42,0:10:13.88,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,When my Hybrid Count goes over its capacity,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.43,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,it might appear, she said.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:17.05,0:10:18.35,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,My mom said that?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:18.64,0:10:21.60,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I told myself that things would work out if I got it.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:22.27,0:10:27.81,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But how could I get my Hybrid Count above capacity when it just kept going down?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:28.32,0:10:31.82,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Just when I thought it might be impossible after all,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:31.82,0:10:35.74,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,you appeared, Hida Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:36.70,0:10:39.20,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,The man who can break \Nthe limits on the Hybrid Count.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:40.20,0:10:41.79,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I was overjoyed.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:42.29,0:10:45.96,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I was filled with hope, \Nand the whole world seemed different.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:47.13,0:10:52.46,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You felt like a prince that Dr. Nayuta had sent me.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:52.67,0:10:54.42,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I told myself I had to make you like me.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:54.42,0:10:56.84,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That I had to make you fall in love me.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:57.34,0:11:00.22,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:00.85,0:11:03.39,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I looked at everything I could find in the database.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:03.98,0:11:09.73,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,A magazine that boys read said that\N they liked it when girls made them lunch.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:10.23,0:11:14.19,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But I couldn't cook, so I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:14.19,0:11:16.61,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But even so, I still managed to make that lunch.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:18.03,0:11:21.28,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And then I read a naughty book for boys,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:21.28,0:11:24.29,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,to find out what would make you happy.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:24.29,0:11:26.79,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's why you came to wake me up that morning?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:27.08,0:11:31.46,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I-I was actually planning on doing\N all sorts of things to wake you up.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:31.46,0:11:33.42,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,B-But I couldn't.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:34.63,0:11:35.92,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,And the other day...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I didn't know what you would do,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:39.34,0:11:40.72,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,and I was scared...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:41.26,0:11:45.14,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But I thought it might get you to make a move on me.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:45.64,0:11:47.94,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It didn't work, though.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:47.94,0:11:51.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I didn't get my Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:51.02,0:11:55.07,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,In the end, I was useless.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:55.07,0:11:57.65,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,There was no reason for me to even be alive after all.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:00.03,0:12:01.62,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Either way,
Dialogue: 30,0:12:01.62,0:12:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with that huge fleet out there, Ataraxia might be finished.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:05.66,0:12:07.66,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Everyone's going to die, and it's my fault.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:07.66,0:12:08.92,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:10.75,0:12:11.79,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:11.79,0:12:13.46,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Worthless?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:13.46,0:12:15.21,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Useless?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:15.21,0:12:18.09,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You're just upset nobody's telling you how great you are!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:18.09,0:12:20.39,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Don't act like you know anything!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:20.84,0:12:22.55,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,So what if you can't beat someone?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:22.55,0:12:25.22,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,So what if some people are better than you?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.18,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Don't throw a tantrum and put yourself down.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:27.18,0:12:29.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:29.10,0:12:32.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't want to be lectured by someone who doesn't understand a thing!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:32.02,0:12:32.90,Dialogue Alternate,A,0,0,0,,Zeros!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:34.82,0:12:36.82,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Even if you think you don't have any talents,
Dialogue: 30,0:12:36.82,0:12:38.61,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,and that you're nothing special,
Dialogue: 30,0:12:38.61,0:12:40.82,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,try to figure out what you can do,
Dialogue: 30,0:12:40.82,0:12:43.78,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,and how you can be of help.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:43.78,0:12:45.79,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That's the kind of outlook you need to have.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:46.20,0:12:49.92,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,If you do, you'll find that everyone in this world has a purpose!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:04.22,0:13:05.89,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Why didn't you dodge?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:07.27,0:13:11.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,At least deploy your Absolute Zone, you idiot.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:11.10,0:13:13.23,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:13.61,0:13:14.23,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:14.90,0:13:15.98,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Let me see that.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:21.57,0:13:25.20,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,The enemy hit me harder than I thought they would.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:26.28,0:13:28.12,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You dummy! You dummy!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.21,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You fool! You useless dummy!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:30.21,0:13:33.29,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're weak... You don't have any power...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:34.25,0:13:36.88,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,So dodge!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:37.25,0:13:41.76,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Why did you do that for me, \Nwhen I can't even fight anymore?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:42.43,0:13:47.51,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,All I can do now is die...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:47.51,0:13:49.27,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I helped my mom,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:50.18,0:13:52.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hida Nayuta, with her research here.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:54.27,0:13:58.82,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But somebody who was better for the research appeared,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:58.82,0:14:00.82,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,and I was told I wasn't needed anymore.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:06.62,0:14:10.33,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I didn't know anything but the experiments, but she threw me away anyway.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:11.08,0:14:13.37,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,When I went to the Tokyo Float{ alone},
Dialogue: 30,0:14:13.37,0:14:16.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and started going to school, things were really bad.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:16.67,0:14:20.21,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Because I could barely even talk to anyone.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:20.80,0:14:21.26,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:22.30,0:14:26.55,Dialogue Flashback,H,0,0,0,,A person's value isn't decided by their abilities.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:29.56,0:14:31.81,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It's decided by how they live.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:33.18,0:14:35.44,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,We can always go back and do things over.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:35.44,0:14:37.48,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,We can always start over.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:38.19,0:14:40.48,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That's what I learned then.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:41.53,0:14:42.32,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:42.86,0:14:45.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to live.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:46.36,0:14:47.53,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Neither do I.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:48.03,0:14:52.00,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,So let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:53.46,0:14:54.66,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:55.17,0:14:58.04,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna, um...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:58.04,0:15:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do a Heart Hybrid with me, would you?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:01.92,0:15:04.76,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I can start over, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:04.76,0:15:07.84,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing, but I don't mind if it's with you.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:08.72,0:15:09.64,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Aine...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:10.22,0:15:12.68,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Take responsibility, okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:13.18,0:15:14.23,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:24.65,0:15:28.82,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Please, don't toy with my body...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:50.35,0:15:51.64,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:52.26,0:15:54.52,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It feels good.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:56.52,0:15:57.77,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You're so cute.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:12.70,0:16:14.66,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It worked,
Dialogue: 30,0:16:14.66,0:16:16.00,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:18.75,0:16:21.79,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna, I want more.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:22.21,0:16:25.55,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You haven't had enough yet, either, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:26.38,0:16:28.05,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hey, Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:28.05,0:16:30.76,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,My body feels hot.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:30.76,0:16:32.93,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hurry up and take responsibility.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:32.93,0:16:35.18,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Wh-What's gotten into you, Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:35.56,0:16:37.06,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:37.06,0:16:38.18,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Shikina-san!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:38.77,0:16:41.40,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,It's a side effect of the Heart Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:41.40,0:16:43.57,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,When a Heart Hybrid is successful,
Dialogue: 30,0:16:43.57,0:16:47.03,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,the girl is overcome with strong symptoms that resemble lust.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:47.03,0:16:47.99,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Their libido goes into overdrive.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:47.99,0:16:49.32,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That's a huge nuisance!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:49.82,0:16:52.74,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,But if you can use that effect properly,
Dialogue: 30,0:16:52.74,0:16:55.49,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,you can proceed to a higher stage.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:56.20,0:16:57.58,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,A higher stage?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:57.58,0:17:00.79,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Yes, a new kind of Hybrid that will allow for the acquisition
Dialogue: 30,0:17:00.79,0:17:02.38,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,of Immoral Weapons.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:02.38,0:17:03.88,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,The Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:04.59,0:17:06.84,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Hey, Aine, what are you...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:07.84,0:17:10.47,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're talking to another woman
Dialogue: 30,0:17:10.47,0:17:12.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,while you should be pleasuring me?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:13.26,0:17:16.14,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Th-That's not true, Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:16.14,0:17:18.22,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You're all I'm thinking about right now.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:18.68,0:17:22.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Then prove it.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:22.02,0:17:23.77,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:31.03,0:17:32.28,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Aine...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:41.92,0:17:43.17,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Oh, Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:46.54,0:17:49.34,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It feels so good, Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:50.72,0:17:52.05,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:02.02,0:18:03.65,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,I-I can't breathe...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:04.15,0:18:06.82,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,This is bad, I'll suffocate at this rate!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:09.73,0:18:11.07,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:17.62,0:18:18.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:41.68,0:18:42.23,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:50.61,0:18:51.94,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:53.24,0:18:54.28,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:54.28,0:18:55.66,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Aine-san!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:55.66,0:18:57.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Are you two okay?!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:58.12,0:18:58.99,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:58.99,0:19:00.24,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You saved us!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:07.79,0:19:11.30,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're going to pay for all this.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:12.88,0:19:15.26,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Pulverizer!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:26.85,0:19:28.23,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:28.23,0:19:30.27,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Zeros has a new weapon?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:31.27,0:19:31.71,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Connect!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:38.16,0:19:41.99,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,The Climax Hybrid succeeded, didn't it?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:41.99,0:19:44.79,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,That is her Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:44.79,0:19:46.71,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Now it's our turn.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:47.42,0:19:48.67,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:54.26,0:19:57.09,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'll buy you time till you can blast that thing.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:59.68,0:20:00.85,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Zeros Mode!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.36,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That's Eros?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:10.36,0:20:14.44,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It seems as fast and powerful as Zeros!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:24.58,0:20:25.83,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:27.46,0:20:28.33,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Blast!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:43.14,0:20:45.22,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Enemy battleship has disappeared from the radar!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:47.60,0:20:50.60,Dialogue Top Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,The enemy fleet has withdrawn beyond firing range.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:51.77,0:20:52.86,Dialogue Top Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Victory is ours!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:53.69,0:20:54.82,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:54.82,0:20:55.86,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:24.51,0:21:27.52,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Why are you standing out here, looking so glum?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:28.06,0:21:30.73,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What about you? Did you enjoy the party?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:31.44,0:21:34.40,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm tired after being dragged around everywhere.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:34.94,0:21:36.19,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:36.19,0:21:37.48,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hey, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:38.48,0:21:43.99,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I got something else besides the Immoral Weapon
Dialogue: 30,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,when we did Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:46.62,0:21:48.33,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.37,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,A fragment of my memories.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:50.37,0:21:51.66,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:52.75,0:21:55.92,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,A beautiful lake, and snow-covered mountain peaks.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:56.54,0:21:59.67,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,A huge city with tall buildings.
Dialogue: 30,0:22:00.09,0:22:04.76,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And a huge, complicated mechanical clock that covered a whole wall.
Dialogue: 30,0:22:06.05,0:22:08.06,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 30,0:22:08.56,0:22:10.22,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,So, I want us to do it again—
